  Key structures:

  ```python
  #!/usr/bin/env python3
  """#645 对话蒸馏管线 ..."""

  Sources:
  - kimi wire: Path.home()/'.kimi-code/sessions'/*/session_*/agents/*/wire.jsonl
  - headless logs: WIKI/'logs'/headless-*.log
  - hermes: Path.home()/'.hermes/state.db' (graceful skip)

  Incremental cursor: .kdo/conversation_distill_state.json {"files": {path: offset}, "watermark_ts": ms}
  Modes:
    default (daily): since = watermark, until = now; update state
    --since/--until: trial; --no-save to not update cursor
    --max-chunks N (cost cap, default 8)
